<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - WPP Group started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - WPP Group started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities initiated coverage of WPP Group Inc as a buy, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.  </p>
<p>-- Shares slipped 1/8 to 39-1/2 in early trading.</p>
<p>-- Prudential later confirmed that coverage start by analyst James Dougherty.</p>
</text>
